ungen sind hochgradig anpassbar und k\u00f6nnen f\u00fcr eigene Projekte genutzt werden.", "short_description": "Artivact ist ein kostenloses, quelloffenes Werkzeug zur Sammlungsverwaltung und -pr\u00e4sentation.\nMit Artivact XR kannst du diese Sammlungen in der virtuellen Realit\u00e4t erleben."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "quest_portrait.png", "id": "4209759382644599", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393841_4209759385977932_3266183942185304833_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C_t2CcforRIQ7kNvwHrq86u&_nc_oc=AdpQ5dCBC5B8fLLYEnI0Gt_2O4__IU5OWKYIdSCH2SciUb1OsWiiX_ZAGi1eCAOG85Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLu4OzRpfa8ZLwcf2ruU8fqS6sYLZSBximP50d-9sPkbQ&oe=6AB14B7C"}, {"file_name": "quest_hero_cover.png", "id": "1263316755151138", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292244_1263316758484471_159357681156275043_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3Cx7HiN838MQ7kNvwHtHkfF&_nc_oc=AdoQp-CbRkQ7W0R364B3VJXH2JZZ5ayhVtCfwg89YZbEBLQbrlC7_eB1IsVHsoTeSGg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKHDKV5MpCvP3QlE6k8yNr5ujVKFWKlfliHSY61gddjBg&oe=6AB12F96"}, {"file_name": "quest_landscape.png", "id": "1039024501005104", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_1039024504338437_7487200977707356540_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8mLDYrK21vUQ7kNvwGvmZTn&_nc_oc=AdrCV-_4F1_18otvV2WnsAclu1nEqp_v3fq11pBV3t5Mrt7NrXFXTObrEtD9_LUlQ84&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKCU4JfXRiRqgL5TeJIfHnzj0DG1tEPuAcbKEdQHSpSsA&oe=6AB13D64"}, {"file_name": "quest_logo.png", "id": "707346191636121", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302233_707346198302787_7894586970020286030_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_